#: game/content/achievements.gd:12
msgctxt "tier"
msgid "Bronze"
msgstr "Bronze"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:12
msgctxt "tier"
msgid "Gold"
msgstr "Gold"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:12
msgctxt "tier"
msgid "Legendary"
msgstr "Legendär"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:12
msgctxt "tier"
msgid "Silver"
msgstr "Silber"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:13
msgid "ARCADE & SECRETS"
msgstr "ARCADE & GEHEIMNISSE"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:13
msgid "LEGENDS"
msgstr "LEGENDEN"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:13
msgid "THE BAG & THE SHOP"
msgstr "BEUTEL & LADEN"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:13
msgid "THE CAMPAIGN"
msgstr "DIE KAMPAGNE"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:13
msgid "THE SCOREBOARD"
msgstr "DIE ANZEIGETAFEL"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:21
msgid "Clear your first line."
msgstr "Räume deine erste Linie ab."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:21
msgid "First Crack"
msgstr "Erster Riss"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:21
msgid "It's a start. A very satisfying start."
msgstr "Ein Anfang. Ein sehr befriedigender Anfang."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:22
msgid "The target never stood a chance."
msgstr "Das Ziel hatte nie eine Chance."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:22
msgid "Warmed Up"
msgstr "Aufgewärmt"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:22
msgid "Win a round."
msgstr "Gewinne eine Runde."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:23
msgid "Boss Buster"
msgstr "Bossbrecher"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:23
msgid "Defeat a boss."
msgstr "Besiege einen Boss."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:23
msgid "They always look bigger on the poster."
msgstr "Auf dem Plakat sehen sie immer größer aus."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:24
msgid "Intermission is over. Back to your seats."
msgstr "Die Pause ist vorbei. Zurück auf die Plätze."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:24
msgid "Reach Act 2 (round 5)."
msgstr "Erreiche Akt 2 (Runde 5)."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:24
msgid "Second Act"
msgstr "Zweiter Akt"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:25
msgid "Final Act"
msgstr "Letzter Akt"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:25
msgid "Reach Act 3 (round 9)."
msgstr "Erreiche Akt 3 (Runde 9)."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:25
msgid "The curtain is starting to twitch."
msgstr "Der Vorhang fängt an zu zucken."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:26
msgid "Blink and you missed it."
msgstr "Einmal geblinzelt, schon vorbei."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:26
msgid "Speedrunner"
msgstr "Speedrunner"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:26
msgid "Win a round in five placements or fewer."
msgstr "Gewinne eine Runde in fünf Zügen oder weniger."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:27
msgid "BLOCKMANIA!"
msgstr "BLOCKMANIA!"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:27
msgid "Beat the game: win round 12."
msgstr "Schlag das Spiel: Gewinne Runde 12."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:27
msgid "Twelve rounds, three bosses, one very full board."
msgstr "Zwölf Runden, drei Bosse, ein sehr volles Brett."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:28
msgid "A good builder never blames the Kit."
msgstr "Ein guter Baumeister gibt nie dem Kit die Schuld."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:28
msgid "Beat the game with any Kit other than the Standard Kit."
msgstr "Schlag das Spiel mit einem anderen Kit als dem Standard-Kit."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:28
msgid "Different Tools"
msgstr "Anderes Werkzeug"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:29 game/content/tips.gd:33
msgid "Overtime"
msgstr "Verlängerung"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:29
msgid "The arcade was supposed to close an hour ago."
msgstr "Die Spielhalle sollte schon vor einer Stunde schließen."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:29
msgid "Win a round in Overtime (after beating the game, keep playing)."
msgstr "Gewinne eine Runde in der Verlängerung (nach dem Sieg einfach weiterspielen)."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:30
msgid "Every target is a cliff now."
msgstr "Jedes Ziel ist jetzt eine Steilwand."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:30
msgid "Reach round 20 in Overtime."
msgstr "Erreiche Runde 20 in der Verlängerung."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:30
msgid "Sudden Death"
msgstr "Sudden Death"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:31
msgid "No Off Switch"
msgstr "Kein Ausschalter"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:31
msgid "Reach round 30 in Overtime."
msgstr "Erreiche Runde 30 in der Verlängerung."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:31
msgid "Somebody unplug this thing."
msgstr "Kann mal jemand den Stecker ziehen?"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:32
msgid "Broke the Machine"
msgstr "Maschine kaputt"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:32
msgid "ERR ERR ERR. Please insert more digits."
msgstr "ERR ERR ERR. Bitte mehr Ziffern einwerfen."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:32
msgid "Score a single placement past the machine's limit (1,000,000,000,000,000 points)."
msgstr "Übertriff mit einem einzigen Zug das Limit der Maschine (1 000 000 000 000 000 Punkte)."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:32
msgid "Some scores are too big for any machine."
msgstr "Manche Punktzahlen sind für jede Maschine zu groß."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:34
msgid "Blue Period"
msgstr "Blaue Periode"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:34
msgid "Feeling a little blue? Feeling VERY blue."
msgstr "Ein bisschen blau? Nein: SEHR blau."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:34
msgid "Have 10 or more blue pieces in your bag."
msgstr "Habe 10 oder mehr blaue Teile im Beutel."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:35
msgid "Have 10 or more Square pieces (2x2 or 3x3) in your bag."
msgstr "Habe 10 oder mehr Quadrat-Teile (2x2 oder 3x3) im Beutel."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:35
msgid "Square Dance"
msgstr "Quadrille"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:35
msgid "Swing your partner, stack your blocks."
msgstr "Dreh die Partnerin, stapel die Blöcke."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:36
msgid "Full Spectrum"
msgstr "Volles Spektrum"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:36
msgid "Have at least five pieces of every color in your bag."
msgstr "Habe mindestens fünf Teile jeder Farbe im Beutel."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:36
msgid "Taste the whole toybox."
msgstr "Probier die ganze Spielzeugkiste."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:37
msgid "Have 40 or more pieces in your bag."
msgstr "Habe 40 oder mehr Teile im Beutel."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:37
msgid "Packrat"
msgstr "Hamster"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:37
msgid "You never know when you'll need a spare T."
msgstr "Man weiß nie, wann man ein Ersatz-T braucht."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:38
msgid "Only the essentials."
msgstr "Nur das Nötigste."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:38
msgid "Shrink your bag to 14 pieces or fewer."
msgstr "Verkleinere deinen Beutel auf 14 Teile oder weniger."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:38
msgid "Travel Light"
msgstr "Leichtes Gepäck"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:39
msgid "Alchemist"
msgstr "Alchemist"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:39
msgid "Own pieces of all five materials at once: Chrome, Neon, Gold, Glass and Prism."
msgstr "Besitze gleichzeitig Teile aus allen fünf Materialien: Chrom, Neon, Gold, Glas und Prisma."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:39
msgid "Plastic into gold, gold into glass."
msgstr "Aus Plastik wird Gold, aus Gold wird Glas."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:40
msgid "Own pieces with all four stamps at once: Encore, Refund, Tip and Memory."
msgstr "Besitze gleichzeitig Teile mit allen vier Stempeln: Zugabe, Rückgabe, Trinkgeld und Gedächtnis."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:40
msgid "Signed, sealed, stamped four times."
msgstr "Unterschrieben, versiegelt, viermal gestempelt."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:40
msgid "Special Delivery"
msgstr "Eilzustellung"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:41
msgid "Fill every Joker slot."
msgstr "Belege jeden Joker-Platz."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:41
msgid "Full House"
msgstr "Ausgebucht"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:41
msgid "No vacancies at the Joker hotel."
msgstr "Im Joker-Hotel ist kein Zimmer mehr frei."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:42
msgid "Hold three Rare Jokers at the same time."
msgstr "Habe drei seltene Joker gleichzeitig."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:42
msgid "Only the finest cardboard."
msgstr "Nur der feinste Karton."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:42
msgid "Rare Taste"
msgstr "Erlesener Geschmack"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:43
msgid "Master Plan"
msgstr "Masterplan"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:43
msgid "Raise a shape family to Schematic level 3."
msgstr "Bringe eine Formfamilie auf Bauplan-Stufe 3."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:43
msgid "The blueprints have blueprints."
msgstr "Die Baupläne haben Baupläne."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:44
msgid "Hold 50 or more Credits."
msgstr "Habe 50 oder mehr Credits."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:44
msgid "Oink."
msgstr "Oink."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:44
msgid "Piggy Bank"
msgstr "Sparschwein"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:45
msgid "Even a wallet has a limit."
msgstr "Selbst ein Geldbeutel hat ein Limit."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:45
msgid "Hold the maximum 99 Credits."
msgstr "Habe das Maximum von 99 Credits."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:45
msgid "Scrooge"
msgstr "Geizhals"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:45
msgid "Swimming in coins is harder than it looks."
msgstr "In Münzen zu baden ist schwerer, als es aussieht."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:47
msgid "Big Hit"
msgstr "Volltreffer"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:47
msgid "Ka-chunk."
msgstr "Ka-tschank."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:47
msgid "Score 1,000 points with one placement."
msgstr "Erziele 1 000 Punkte mit einem Zug."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:48
msgid "Mega Hit"
msgstr "Mega-Treffer"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:48
msgid "Score 10,000 points with one placement."
msgstr "Erziele 10 000 Punkte mit einem Zug."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:48
msgid "The receipt printer is sweating."
msgstr "Der Bondrucker schwitzt."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:49
msgid "Giga Hit"
msgstr "Giga-Treffer"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:49
msgid "Score 1,000,000 points with one placement."
msgstr "Erziele 1 000 000 Punkte mit einem Zug."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:49
msgid "That's a lot of zeros for one little piece."
msgstr "Ganz schön viele Nullen für so ein kleines Teil."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:50
msgid "Clear three lines with one placement."
msgstr "Räume drei Linien mit einem Zug ab."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:50
msgid "Stacked high and cleared clean."
msgstr "Hoch gestapelt, sauber abgeräumt."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:50
msgid "Triple Decker"
msgstr "Dreistöckig"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:51
msgid "Clear four or more lines with one placement."
msgstr "Räume vier oder mehr Linien mit einem Zug ab."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:51
msgid "Four-Alarm Fire"
msgstr "Großalarm"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:51
msgid "Somebody call the block brigade."
msgstr "Ruft die Block-Feuerwehr!"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:52
msgid "Clear a row and a column with one placement."
msgstr "Räume eine Zeile und eine Spalte mit einem Zug ab."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:52
msgid "Crossroads"
msgstr "Kreuzung"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:52
msgid "X marks the spot."
msgstr "X markiert die Stelle."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:53
msgid "Don't touch the board, it's hot."
msgstr "Nicht das Brett anfassen, es ist heiß."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:53
msgid "Reach the maximum combo (x4)."
msgstr "Erreiche die maximale Kombo (x4)."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:53
msgid "Red Hot"
msgstr "Glühend heiß"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:54
msgid "Finish a round with at least three times its target."
msgstr "Beende eine Runde mit mindestens dem Dreifachen ihres Ziels."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:54
msgid "Overkill"
msgstr "Overkill"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:54
msgid "The target asked for a little. You gave a lot."
msgstr "Das Ziel wollte ein bisschen. Du hast richtig geliefert."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:55
msgid "By a Thread"
msgstr "Um Haaresbreite"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:55
msgid "Close. So close. Close enough!"
msgstr "Knapp. Ganz knapp. Knapp genug!"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:55
msgid "Win a round with your very last placement."
msgstr "Gewinne eine Runde mit deinem allerletzten Zug."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:56
msgid "Leave the board completely empty after a clear (campaign)."
msgstr "Hinterlasse das Brett nach dem Abräumen komplett leer (Kampagne)."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:56
msgid "Spotless"
msgstr "Blitzblank"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:56
msgid "You could eat off this board."
msgstr "Von diesem Brett könnte man essen."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:57
msgid "Get dealt a Grand Slam Tray Hand."
msgstr "Bekomme ein Grand-Slam-Blatt in die Auslage."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:57 game/rules/hands.gd:17
msgid "Grand Slam"
msgstr "Grand Slam"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:57
msgid "Three of a kind, one color, all the lights."
msgstr "Drei Gleiche, eine Farbe, alle Lichter an."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:58
msgid "Full Deck"
msgstr "Volles Deck"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:58
msgid "See all five Tray Hands (across any runs)."
msgstr "Sieh alle fünf Blätter der Auslage (über alle Partien)."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:58
msgid "Twins, Staircase, Monochrome, Triplets, Grand Slam. Collected."
msgstr "Zwillinge, Treppe, Einfarbig, Drillinge, Grand Slam. Gesammelt."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:60
msgid "Arcade Rookie"
msgstr "Spielhallen-Neuling"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:60
msgid "Put your initials in. Go on."
msgstr "Trag deine Initialen ein. Na los."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:60
msgid "Score 5,000 points in one Endless game."
msgstr "Erziele 5 000 Punkte in einem Endlos-Spiel."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:61
msgid "Arcade Regular"
msgstr "Spielhallen-Stammgast"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:61
msgid "Score 25,000 points in one Endless game."
msgstr "Erziele 25 000 Punkte in einem Endlos-Spiel."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:61
msgid "The cabinet knows your name."
msgstr "Der Automat kennt deinen Namen."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:62
msgid "Arcade Legend"
msgstr "Spielhallen-Legende"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:62
msgid "Score 100,000 points in one Endless game."
msgstr "Erziele 100 000 Punkte in einem Endlos-Spiel."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:62
msgid "They're going to name the cabinet after you."
msgstr "Sie werden den Automaten nach dir benennen."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:63
msgid "Blockstorm"
msgstr "Blocksturm"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:63
msgid "Reach the x10 combo in Endless."
msgstr "Erreiche die x10-Kombo im Endlos-Modus."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:63
msgid "Ten out of ten. No notes."
msgstr "Zehn von zehn. Keine Anmerkungen."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:64
msgid "Ahh. That new-board smell."
msgstr "Ahh. Dieser Neues-Brett-Geruch."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:64
msgid "Clear the whole board in Endless."
msgstr "Räume im Endlos-Modus das ganze Brett leer."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:64
msgid "Fresh Start"
msgstr "Neuanfang"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:65
msgid "BL...CKM...NIA? Where did everything go?"
msgstr "BL...CKM...NIA? Wo ist denn alles hin?"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:65
msgid "Have every letter of the BLOCKMANIA logo blown up at once."
msgstr "Lass alle Buchstaben des BLOCKMANIA-Logos gleichzeitig platzen."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:65
msgid "The title looks awfully fragile."
msgstr "Der Titel sieht furchtbar zerbrechlich aus."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:65
msgid "Vandal"
msgstr "Vandale"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:66
msgid "Night Shift"
msgstr "Nachtschicht"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:66
msgid "Place a piece between midnight and 5 AM."
msgstr "Lege ein Teil zwischen Mitternacht und 5 Uhr morgens."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:66
msgid "Some players only come out after dark."
msgstr "Manche Spieler kommen erst nach Einbruch der Dunkelheit."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:66
msgid "The blocks glow brighter at night. Probably."
msgstr "Nachts leuchten die Blöcke heller. Vermutlich."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:67
msgid "Look Ma, No Lines"
msgstr "Schau, Mama, ohne Linien"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:67
msgid "Technically, the rules never said you HAD to."
msgstr "Genau genommen stand nirgends, dass man MUSS."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:67
msgid "Who needs lines anyway?"
msgstr "Wer braucht schon Linien?"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:67
msgid "Win a campaign round without clearing a single line."
msgstr "Gewinne eine Kampagnenrunde, ohne eine einzige Linie abzuräumen."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:68
msgid "Butterfingers"
msgstr "Butterfinger"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:68
msgid "Handle with care."
msgstr "Vorsicht, zerbrechlich."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:68
msgid "Shatter a Glass piece."
msgstr "Zerbrich ein Glasteil."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:68
msgid "That one's coming out of your allowance."
msgstr "Das geht von deinem Taschengeld ab."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:69
msgid "In case of emergency, break something."
msgstr "Im Notfall etwas kaputt machen."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:69
msgid "Through the Window"
msgstr "Durchs Fenster"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:69
msgid "Throw an Emergency Brick."
msgstr "Wirf einen Notfallziegel."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:69
msgid "Who's paying for that?"
msgstr "Wer bezahlt das jetzt?"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:70
msgid "Always read the small text."
msgstr "Lies immer das Kleingedruckte."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:70
msgid "Get a lost round replayed by Insurance Policy."
msgstr "Lass dir eine verlorene Runde von der Versicherung wiederholen."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:70
msgid "Terms and conditions apply. Luckily, they applied to you."
msgstr "Es gelten die AGB. Zum Glück galten sie für dich."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:70
msgid "The Fine Print"
msgstr "Das Kleingedruckte"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:71
msgid "Block Maniac"
msgstr "Blockmaniac"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:71
msgid "The whole trophy case. Every last shelf. Take a bow."
msgstr "Die ganze Vitrine. Jedes einzelne Regalbrett. Verbeugung!"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:71
msgid "Unlock every other achievement."
msgstr "Schalte alle anderen Erfolge frei."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:73
msgid "It hums a little when you hold it."
msgstr "Er summt ein bisschen, wenn man ihn hält."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:73
msgid "Once Upon a Legend"
msgstr "Es war einmal eine Legende"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:73
msgid "Own a Legendary Joker."
msgstr "Besitze einen legendären Joker."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:74
msgid "Double Legend"
msgstr "Doppelte Legende"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:74
msgid "One legend is a story. Two is a problem."
msgstr "Eine Legende ist eine Geschichte. Zwei sind ein Problem."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:74
msgid "Own two Legendary Jokers at the same time."
msgstr "Besitze zwei legendäre Joker gleichzeitig."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:74
msgid "The rack has never looked so smug."
msgstr "Das Regal sah noch nie so selbstgefällig aus."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:75
msgid "Own each of the four Legendary Jokers (across any runs)."
msgstr "Besitze jeden der vier legendären Joker (über alle Partien)."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:75
msgid "Pantheon"
msgstr "Pantheon"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:75
msgid "The Avalanche, the Mirrors, the Stone and the Star. All accounted for."
msgstr "Die Lawine, die Spiegel, der Stein und der Stern. Alle beisammen."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:76
msgid "Chain Reaction"
msgstr "Kettenreaktion"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:76
msgid "Chain three clear waves in one placement with The Avalanche."
msgstr "Verkette mit der Lawine drei Abräumwellen in einem Zug."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:76
msgid "Nobody touch anything. Let it fall."
msgstr "Niemand fasst etwas an. Lass es fallen."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:77
msgid "How many of you are in there?"
msgstr "Wie viele von dir sind da drin?"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:77
msgid "Mirror World"
msgstr "Spiegelwelt"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:77
msgid "Score a placement where Hall of Mirrors doubles four other Jokers."
msgstr "Punkte mit einem Zug, bei dem der Spiegelsaal vier andere Joker verdoppelt."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:78
msgid "Chrome, neon, gold and glass. Very little plastic left."
msgstr "Chrom, Neon, Gold und Glas. Kaum noch Plastik übrig."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:78
msgid "Have 15 or more pieces with a material in your bag."
msgstr "Habe 15 oder mehr Teile mit Material im Beutel."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:78
msgid "Heavy Metal"
msgstr "Heavy Metal"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:79
msgid "Eighteen lines and one very bright star."
msgstr "Achtzehn Linien und ein sehr heller Stern."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:79
msgid "Going Nova"
msgstr "Auf zur Nova"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:79
msgid "Score with Supernova at x10 Mult or more."
msgstr "Punkte mit Supernova bei x10 Mult oder mehr."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:80
msgid "Grow Snowball to x2 Mult or more."
msgstr "Lass Schneeball auf x2 Mult oder mehr wachsen."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:80
msgid "It started as a pebble of snow."
msgstr "Es fing mit einer Schneeflocke an."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:80
msgid "Snowed In"
msgstr "Eingeschneit"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:81
msgid "Compound Growth"
msgstr "Zinseszins"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:81
msgid "Earn the maximum interest (+5 Credits) after a round."
msgstr "Kassiere nach einer Runde die maximalen Zinsen (+5 Credits)."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:81
msgid "Your Credits have been working harder than you."
msgstr "Deine Credits haben härter gearbeitet als du."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:82
msgid "Have seven Joker slots."
msgstr "Habe sieben Joker-Plätze."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:82
msgid "Two Rack Extenders and a lot of shelf brackets."
msgstr "Zwei Regalerweiterungen und viele Winkel."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:82
msgid "Wide Rack"
msgstr "Breites Regal"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:83
msgid "Billionaire"
msgstr "Milliardär"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:83
msgid "Nine zeros. The counter had to borrow some."
msgstr "Neun Nullen. Der Zähler musste sich welche leihen."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:83
msgid "Score 1,000,000,000 points with one placement."
msgstr "Erziele 1 000 000 000 Punkte mit einem Zug."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:84
msgid "Even legends have bad days."
msgstr "Auch Legenden haben schlechte Tage."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:84
msgid "Fallen Hero"
msgstr "Gefallener Held"

#: game/content/achievements.gd:84
msgid "Lose a run while owning a Legendary Joker."
msgstr "Verliere eine Partie, während du einen legendären Joker besitzt."

#: game/content/achievements.gd:84
msgid "They'll write songs about it. Sad ones."
msgstr "Man wird Lieder darüber schreiben. Traurige."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:7
msgid "Cramped Cabinet"
msgstr "Enger Schrank"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:7
msgid "The Cramped Cabinet"
msgstr "Der Enge Schrank"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:8
msgid "The round begins with four fixed occupied cells. They clear normally and score no placement Chips."
msgstr "Die Runde beginnt mit vier fest belegten Feldern. Sie werden normal abgeräumt und bringen keine Zug-Chips."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:9
msgid "The round begins with seven fixed occupied cells. They clear normally and score no placement Chips."
msgstr "Die Runde beginnt mit sieben fest belegten Feldern. Sie werden normal abgeräumt und bringen keine Zug-Chips."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:10
msgid "Favor small shapes or board-clearing tools."
msgstr "Setz auf kleine Formen oder Werkzeuge, die das Brett freiräumen."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:11
msgid "Taxman"
msgstr "Fiskus"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:11
msgid "The Taxman"
msgstr "Der Fiskus"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:12
msgid "The first line cleared by each placement grants 60 instead of 100 base Chips."
msgstr "Die erste Linie, die ein Zug abräumt, bringt 60 statt 100 Basis-Chips."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:13
msgid "The first line cleared by each placement grants 30 instead of 100 base Chips, and multi-line Mult is halved."
msgstr "Die erste Linie, die ein Zug abräumt, bringt 30 statt 100 Basis-Chips, und der Mehrlinien-Mult wird halbiert."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:14
msgid "Pursue double clears and flat Chip Jokers."
msgstr "Setz auf Doppel-Abräumer und Joker mit festen Chips."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:15
msgid "Color Blind"
msgstr "Farbenblinder"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:15
msgid "The Color Blind"
msgstr "Der Farbenblinde"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:16
msgid "Effects that name a block color are disabled this round."
msgstr "Effekte, die eine Blockfarbe nennen, sind in dieser Runde deaktiviert."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:17
msgid "Effects that name a block color are disabled, and you have two fewer placements."
msgstr "Effekte, die eine Blockfarbe nennen, sind deaktiviert, und du hast zwei Züge weniger."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:18
msgid "Diversify beyond color-dependent scoring."
msgstr "Verlass dich nicht nur auf Farben."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:21
msgid "Echo Chamber"
msgstr "Echokammer"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:21
msgid "The Echo Chamber"
msgstr "Die Echokammer"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:22
msgid "Extra clear waves after the first score half Chips before Jokers."
msgstr "Zusätzliche Abräumwellen nach der ersten bringen vor den Jokern nur die halben Chips."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:23
msgid "Prefer immediate clears over chained board effects."
msgstr "Lieber sofort abräumen als auf Ketteneffekte setzen."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:24
msgid "Lockdown"
msgstr "Abriegelung"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:24
msgid "The Lockdown"
msgstr "Die Abriegelung"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:25
msgid "The free Refresh and Second Tray are unavailable this round."
msgstr "Der kostenlose Tausch und die Zweite Auslage sind in dieser Runde nicht verfügbar."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:26
msgid "Refresh, Second Tray, Coffee Break and Hold are all unavailable this round."
msgstr "Tausch, Zweite Auslage, Kaffeepause und Halten sind in dieser Runde nicht verfügbar."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:27
msgid "Plan tray order and preserve board space."
msgstr "Plane die Reihenfolge der Auslage und halte Platz auf dem Brett frei."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:28
msgid "The Warden"
msgstr "Der Wärter"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:28
msgid "Warden"
msgstr "Wärter"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:29
msgid "One tray slot starts barred: its piece can't be played until you clear a line. Deals skip the barred slot."
msgstr "Ein Platz der Auslage ist anfangs gesperrt: Sein Teil kann erst gespielt werden, wenn du eine Linie abräumst. Beim Austeilen wird er übersprungen."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:30
msgid "Two tray slots start barred. Each clearing placement frees one. Deals skip barred slots."
msgstr "Zwei Plätze der Auslage sind anfangs gesperrt. Jeder Zug, der abräumt, gibt einen frei. Beim Austeilen werden sie übersprungen."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:31
msgid "Open with a quick clear using the other two slots."
msgstr "Räum mit den anderen beiden Plätzen schnell eine Linie ab."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:32
msgid "The Undertaker"
msgstr "Der Totengräber"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:32
msgid "Undertaker"
msgstr "Totengräber"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:33
msgid "After every 4th placement, a tombstone rises on an empty cell. It clears with its line like any block."
msgstr "Nach jedem 4. Zug erscheint ein Grabstein auf einem leeren Feld. Er wird mit seiner Linie abgeräumt wie jeder Block."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:34
msgid "After every 3rd placement, a tombstone rises on an empty cell. It clears with its line like any block."
msgstr "Nach jedem 3. Zug erscheint ein Grabstein auf einem leeren Feld. Er wird mit seiner Linie abgeräumt wie jeder Block."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:35
msgid "Clear often and keep lanes open."
msgstr "Räum oft ab und halte Bahnen frei."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:36
msgid "Last Call"
msgstr "Letzte Runde"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:36
msgid "The Last Call"
msgstr "Die Letzte Runde"

#: game/content/bosses.gd:37
msgid "Only 12 placements. Each multi-line placement gains +50 Chips."
msgstr "Nur 12 Züge. Jeder Mehrlinien-Zug erhält +50 Chips."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:38
msgid "Only 10 placements. Each multi-line placement gains +50 Chips."
msgstr "Nur 10 Züge. Jeder Mehrlinien-Zug erhält +50 Chips."

#: game/content/bosses.gd:39
msgid "Prepare efficient shapes and simultaneous clears."
msgstr "Bereite effiziente Formen und gleichzeitige Abräumer vor."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:11
msgid "Add +40 Chips per round number to the next placement this round."
msgstr "Gibt dem nächsten Zug dieser Runde +40 Chips pro Rundennummer."

#. rules text (shown through BMLoc.tf)
#: game/content/consumables.gd:11 game/rules/resolver.gd:225
msgid "Polish"
msgstr "Politur"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:12
msgid "Add +1 Mult per act to the next placement this round."
msgstr "Gibt dem nächsten Zug dieser Runde +1 Mult pro Akt."

#. rules text (shown through BMLoc.tf)
#: game/content/consumables.gd:12 game/rules/resolver.gd:256
msgid "Spark"
msgstr "Funke"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:13
msgid "Eraser"
msgstr "Radiergummi"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:13
msgid "Remove up to three blocks of your choice from the board."
msgstr "Entferne bis zu drei Blöcke deiner Wahl vom Brett."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:14
msgid "Refresh the current tray without spending the round's free Refresh."
msgstr "Tauscht die aktuelle Auslage, ohne den kostenlosen Tausch der Runde zu verbrauchen."

#. rules text (shown through BMLoc.tf)
#: game/content/consumables.gd:14 game/run/run.gd:775
msgid "Second Tray"
msgstr "Zweite Auslage"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:15
msgid "Extra Turn"
msgstr "Extrazug"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:15
msgid "Gain two placements this round (maximum 20 remaining)."
msgstr "Erhalte zwei Züge in dieser Runde (höchstens 20 übrig)."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:16
msgid "Lucky Paint"
msgstr "Glücksfarbe"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:16
msgid "Recolor one tray piece to a color of your choice. Its shape is unchanged."
msgstr "Färbe ein Teil der Auslage in einer Farbe deiner Wahl um. Die Form bleibt gleich."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:17
msgid "Color Purge"
msgstr "Farbsäuberung"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:17
msgid "Remove every block of one color from the board. Stone is immune."
msgstr "Entferne alle Blöcke einer Farbe vom Brett. Stein ist immun."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:18
msgid "Emergency Brick"
msgstr "Notfallziegel"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:18
msgid "Throw a brick at a tray slot: it becomes a temporary one-block piece. A piece it hits goes to the discard pile."
msgstr "Wirf einen Ziegel auf einen Platz der Auslage: Er wird zu einem temporären Ein-Block-Teil. Ein getroffenes Teil kommt auf den Ablagestapel."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:20
msgid "The next placement this round gets x2 Mult."
msgstr "Der nächste Zug dieser Runde erhält x2 Mult."

#. rules text (shown through BMLoc.tf)
#: game/content/consumables.gd:20 game/rules/resolver.gd:278
msgid "Turbo"
msgstr "Turbo"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:21
msgid "Level up the shape family of a tray piece, like a Schematic (+25 Chips, +0.25 Mult per level)."
msgstr "Steigert die Formfamilie eines Teils der Auslage wie ein Bauplan (+25 Chips, +0.25 Mult pro Stufe)."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:21
msgid "Tune-Up"
msgstr "Tuning"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:22
msgid "Coin Roll"
msgstr "Münzrolle"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:22
msgid "Gain Credits equal to the round number (max 12)."
msgstr "Erhalte so viele Credits wie die Rundennummer (max. 12)."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:24
msgid "1 in 5 chance: a random Uncommon or better Joker joins your rack. Needs a free Joker slot."
msgstr "1 zu 5: Ein zufälliger Joker (ungewöhnlich oder besser) kommt in dein Regal. Braucht einen freien Joker-Platz."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:24
msgid "Lucky Draw"
msgstr "Glückslos"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:25
msgid "A random stamp goes on a random unstamped piece in your bag, for good."
msgstr "Ein zufälliger Stempel kommt dauerhaft auf ein ungestempeltes Teil in deinem Beutel."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:25
msgid "Mystery Stamp"
msgstr "Wunderstempel"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:26
msgid "1 in 5 chance to double your Credits (at most +20). Otherwise nothing."
msgstr "1 zu 5, deine Credits zu verdoppeln (höchstens +20). Sonst nichts."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:26
msgid "Double Down"
msgstr "Alles oder nichts"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:27
msgid "Phantom Line"
msgstr "Phantomlinie"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:27
msgid "The next placement that clears a line counts one extra line (Chips, Mult, refills and Jokers)."
msgstr "Der nächste Zug, der eine Linie abräumt, zählt eine Linie mehr (Chips, Mult, Auffüllen und Joker)."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:30
msgid "Punch"
msgstr "Faustschlag"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:30
msgid "Smash a plus-shaped area: remove up to 5 blocks around the cell you hit."
msgstr "Schlag auf ein kreuzförmiges Feld: Entfernt bis zu 5 Blöcke um das getroffene Feld."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:31
msgid "+1 Refresh this round."
msgstr "+1 Tausch in dieser Runde."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:31
msgid "Coffee Break"
msgstr "Kaffeepause"

#. rules text (shown through BMLoc.tf)
#: game/content/consumables.gd:32 game/run/run.gd:1422
msgid "Cash Out"
msgstr "Auszahlung"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:32
msgid "Gain 4 Credits after this round if it is won."
msgstr "Erhalte nach dieser Runde 4 Credits, falls du sie gewinnst."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:33
msgid "Blueprint"
msgstr "Entwurf"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:33
msgid "Swap one tray piece for a temporary 1-3 cell piece you choose."
msgstr "Tausche ein Teil der Auslage gegen ein temporäres Teil mit 1-3 Feldern deiner Wahl."

#: game/content/consumables.gd:130
#, c-format
msgid "+%s Chips"
msgstr "+%s Chips"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:132
#, c-format
msgid "+%s Mult"
msgstr "+%s Mult"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:134
#, c-format
msgid "+%d Credit"
msgid_plural "+%d Credits"
msgstr[0] "+%d Credit"
msgstr[1] "+%d Credits"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:136
#, c-format
msgid "Win +%d"
msgstr "Gewinn +%d"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:139
#, c-format
msgid "%d free Joker slot"
msgid_plural "%d free Joker slots"
msgstr[0] "%d freier Joker-Platz"
msgstr[1] "%d freie Joker-Plätze"

#: game/content/consumables.gd:142
#, c-format
msgid "%d unstamped piece"
msgid_plural "%d unstamped pieces"
msgstr[0] "%d Teil ohne Stempel"
msgstr[1] "%d Teile ohne Stempel"

#: game/content/feats.gd:8
msgid "Clear a row and a column in the same placement."
msgstr "Räume in einem Zug eine Zeile und eine Spalte ab."

#: game/content/feats.gd:8
msgid "Crossfire"
msgstr "Kreuzfeuer"

#: game/content/feats.gd:9
msgid "Clear lines on two placements in a row."
msgstr "Räume in zwei Zügen hintereinander Linien ab."

#: game/content/feats.gd:9
msgid "Double Tap"
msgstr "Doppelschlag"

#: game/content/feats.gd:10
msgid "Clear three or more lines in one placement."
msgstr "Räume drei oder mehr Linien in einem Zug ab."

#: game/content/feats.gd:10
msgid "Hat Trick"
msgstr "Hattrick"

#: game/content/feats.gd:11
msgid "Clean Board"
msgstr "Leeres Brett"

#: game/content/feats.gd:11
msgid "Leave the board completely empty."
msgstr "Hinterlasse das Brett komplett leer."

#: game/content/feats.gd:12
msgid "Fill a one-block hole (closed on all four sides) and clear a line with it."
msgstr "Fülle ein Ein-Block-Loch (an allen vier Seiten zu) und räume damit eine Linie ab."

#: game/content/feats.gd:12
msgid "Needle Threader"
msgstr "Einfädler"

#: game/content/feats.gd:13
msgid "Clear a line with your last placement."
msgstr "Räume mit deinem letzten Zug eine Linie ab."

#: game/content/feats.gd:13
msgid "Last Breath"
msgstr "Letzter Atemzug"

#: game/content/holo.gd:18
msgid "Negative Film"
msgstr "Negativfilm"

#: game/content/holo.gd:19
msgid "A random Joker that is not Negative turns Negative: it no longer takes a Joker slot."
msgstr "Ein zufälliger Joker, der nicht negativ ist, wird negativ: Er belegt keinen Joker-Platz mehr."

#: game/content/holo.gd:20
msgid "AGAIN Seal"
msgstr "NOCHMAL-Siegel"

#: game/content/holo.gd:21
msgid "A random scoring Joker gains AGAIN: after all your Jokers have scored, it triggers once more."
msgstr "Ein zufälliger Punkte-Joker erhält NOCHMAL: Wenn alle deine Joker gewertet haben, löst er noch einmal aus."

#: game/content/holo.gd:22
msgid "Master Schematic"
msgstr "Meisterbauplan"

#: game/content/holo.gd:23
msgid "Every shape family in your bag gains a level (+25 Chips, +0.25 Mult per level)."
msgstr "Jede Formfamilie in deinem Beutel steigt eine Stufe (+25 Chips, +0.25 Mult pro Stufe)."

#: game/content/holo.gd:24
msgid "Master Tuning"
msgstr "Meisterstimmung"

#: game/content/holo.gd:25
#, c-format
msgid "Every scoring Joker below its top level gains a level (+50% of its effect)."
msgstr "Jeder Punkte-Joker unter seiner Höchststufe steigt eine Stufe (Wirkung +50 %)."

#: game/content/holo.gd:26
msgid "Legend Crate"
msgstr "Legendenkiste"

#: game/content/holo.gd:27
msgid "The Legendary Joker shown on this card joins your rack. Needs a free Joker slot."
msgstr "Der legendäre Joker auf dieser Karte kommt in dein Regal. Braucht einen freien Joker-Platz."

#: game/content/holo.gd:28
msgid "Hologram"
msgstr "Hologramm"

#: game/content/holo.gd:29
msgid "A random Joker that is not Legendary gets a Negative copy (the copy takes no slot)."
msgstr "Ein zufälliger, nicht legendärer Joker bekommt eine negative Kopie (die Kopie belegt keinen Platz)."

#: game/content/holo.gd:68
#, c-format
msgid "Legend Crate: %s"
msgstr "Legendenkiste: %s"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:17
msgid "Common"
msgstr "Gewöhnlich"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:17
msgid "Legendary"
msgstr "Legendär"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:17
msgid "Rare"
msgstr "Selten"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:17
msgid "Uncommon"
msgstr "Ungewöhnlich"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:23
msgid "+50 Chips when exactly one line clears."
msgstr "+50 Chips, wenn genau eine Linie abgeräumt wird."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:23
msgid "Clean Sweep"
msgstr "Kehraus"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:24
msgid "+100 Chips when two or more lines clear together; +100 more if they cross (a row and a column)."
msgstr "+100 Chips, wenn zwei oder mehr Linien zusammen abgeräumt werden; +100 extra, wenn sie sich kreuzen (eine Zeile und eine Spalte)."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:24
msgid "Crossbar"
msgstr "Querlatte"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:25
msgid "+15 Chips per placed cell when placing a shape of 1-3 cells."
msgstr "+15 Chips pro gelegtem Feld, wenn du eine Form mit 1-3 Feldern legst."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:25
msgid "Small Change"
msgstr "Kleingeld"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:26
msgid "+100 Chips when placing a shape of 5 or more cells."
msgstr "+100 Chips, wenn du eine Form mit 5 oder mehr Feldern legst."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:26
msgid "Heavy Hand"
msgstr "Schwere Hand"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:27
msgid "First Strike"
msgstr "Erstschlag"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:27
msgid "The first clearing placement each round gains +150 Chips."
msgstr "Der erste abräumende Zug jeder Runde erhält +150 Chips."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:28
msgid "+40 Chips if the placed shape touches no occupied cell diagonally (checked before placement)."
msgstr "+40 Chips, wenn die gelegte Form kein belegtes Feld diagonal berührt (vor dem Legen geprüft)."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:28
msgid "Neat Freak"
msgstr "Ordnungsfanatiker"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:29
msgid "+60 Chips if any placed cell occupies a board corner."
msgstr "+60 Chips, wenn ein gelegtes Feld eine Ecke des Bretts belegt."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:29
msgid "Corner Office"
msgstr "Eckbüro"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:30
msgid "Blue Mood"
msgstr "Blaue Stimmung"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:30
msgid "Blue shapes gain +2 Mult."
msgstr "Blaue Formen erhalten +2 Mult."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:31
msgid "+1 Mult per current combo level on clearing placements."
msgstr "+1 Mult pro aktueller Kombo-Stufe bei abräumenden Zügen."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:31
msgid "Chain Link"
msgstr "Kettenglied"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:32
msgid "+2 Credits after a round won with at least two placements unused."
msgstr "+2 Credits nach einer gewonnenen Runde mit mindestens zwei ungenutzten Zügen."

#. rules text (shown through BMLoc.tf)
#: game/content/jokers.gd:32 game/run/run.gd:1420
msgid "Spare Parts"
msgstr "Ersatzteile"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:33
msgid "Once per round, when no offered shape fits and no tray Refresh is available, replace one unplaced shape with a Single before defeat is checked."
msgstr "Einmal pro Runde: Wenn keine angebotene Form passt und kein Tausch mehr übrig ist, wird eine ungelegte Form durch ein Einzel ersetzt, bevor die Niederlage geprüft wird."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:33
msgid "Tiny Insurance"
msgstr "Mini-Versicherung"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:34
msgid "Second Look"
msgstr "Zweiter Blick"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:34
msgid "The first Refresh each round also grants +1 placement."
msgstr "Der erste Tausch jeder Runde gibt zusätzlich +1 Zug."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:35
msgid "+2 Mult on every clearing placement; +3 more when two or more lines clear."
msgstr "+2 Mult bei jedem abräumenden Zug; +3 extra, wenn zwei oder mehr Linien abgeräumt werden."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:35
msgid "Wide Awake"
msgstr "Hellwach"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:36
msgid "+0.5 Mult when the board has at least 44 empty cells before placement."
msgstr "+0.5 Mult, wenn das Brett vor dem Zug mindestens 44 leere Felder hat."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:36
msgid "Hollow Point"
msgstr "Hohlspitze"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:37
msgid "+0.5 Mult for every eight occupied cells before placement (max +2)."
msgstr "+0.5 Mult je acht belegten Feldern vor dem Zug (max. +2)."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:37
msgid "Pressure Cooker"
msgstr "Schnellkochtopf"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:38
msgid "Every third placed shape in a round gets x1.5 Mult."
msgstr "Jede dritte gelegte Form einer Runde erhält x1.5 Mult."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:38
msgid "Golden Ratio"
msgstr "Goldener Schnitt"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:39
msgid "Color Cycle"
msgstr "Farbkreis"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:39
msgid "When the last three placed shapes this round all have different colors, the third gains x1.75 Mult."
msgstr "Haben die letzten drei gelegten Formen dieser Runde alle verschiedene Farben, erhält die dritte x1.75 Mult."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:40
msgid "After the first clear each round, remove one block of your choice (use it from the Items row). The removal scores nothing."
msgstr "Nach dem ersten Abräumen jeder Runde entfernst du einen Block deiner Wahl (einsetzbar in der Gegenstandsleiste). Das Entfernen bringt keine Punkte."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:40
msgid "Patch Panel"
msgstr "Flickenfeld"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:41
msgid "+1 placement per round. The first placement of each round gains no cell Chips."
msgstr "+1 Zug pro Runde. Der erste Zug jeder Runde bringt keine Feld-Chips."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:41
msgid "Long Game"
msgstr "Langer Atem"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:42
msgid "+0.25 Mult for each Joker sold this run (max +2). Selling this card ends its bonus."
msgstr "+0.25 Mult für jeden in dieser Partie verkauften Joker (max. +2). Wird diese Karte verkauft, endet ihr Bonus."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:42
msgid "Fire Sale"
msgstr "Räumungsverkauf"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:43
msgid "Jackpot Window"
msgstr "Jackpot-Schalter"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:43
msgid "x2.5 Mult when two lines clear in one placement; x5 Mult for three or more."
msgstr "x2.5 Mult, wenn zwei Linien in einem Zug abgeräumt werden; x5 Mult bei drei oder mehr."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:44
msgid "Mirror Maze"
msgstr "Spiegelkabinett"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:44
msgid "The first row clear each round also clears the mirrored row's occupied cells for +50 Chips. The mirrored removal cannot chain."
msgstr "Die erste abgeräumte Zeile jeder Runde räumt auch die belegten Felder der gespiegelten Zeile ab, für +50 Chips. Das Spiegel-Entfernen kann keine Kette auslösen."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:45
msgid "Compound Interest"
msgstr "Zinseszins"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:45
msgid "Every second clearing placement in a round gets x1.75 Mult."
msgstr "Jeder zweite abräumende Zug einer Runde erhält x1.75 Mult."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:46
msgid "Last Stand"
msgstr "Letztes Gefecht"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:46
msgid "Placements made with four or fewer placements left gain x2.5 Mult."
msgstr "Züge mit vier oder weniger verbleibenden Zügen erhalten x2.5 Mult."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:48
msgid "+1 Chip for each piece in your bag."
msgstr "+1 Chip für jedes Teil in deinem Beutel."

#: game/content/jokers.gd:48
